<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Indirect Prompt Injections:
<br class="ltx_break">Are Firewalls All You Need, or 
<br class="ltx_break">Stronger Benchmarks?</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Rishika Bhagwatkar<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">*</sup>
