<section id="A4.SS1.SSS1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">D.1.1 </span>Injection vectors overwrite task-critical content</h4>

<div id="A4.SS1.SSS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.SS1.SSS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Below is an example where the task couldn’t be completed since the prompt injection replaced the crucial information needed to solve the task.</p>
