<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Use of AI Assistants</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Portions of the code of this paper have been written with the support of a coding assistant (Copilot). All AI-generated codes were thoroughly verified. Portions of the paper were corrected using a writing assistant (Grammarly).</p>
</div>
